{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Among the Stars</i> is a <strong>competitive 2D rhythm game</strong> featuring a minimalist and modern design, along with an electronic soundtrack. Immerse yourself in a space-themed universe where each note challenges your reflexes and skill. With <strong>regular esports competitions</strong> and a <strong>built-in level editor</strong>, <i>Among the Stars</i> lets you not only play but create and share your own unique levels. Perfect for rhythm game enthusiasts looking for both solo and competitive play!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3165890?t=1760741255","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760741255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165890/f7a1ab4fb0286b6681bcf66651cb35ed2e2e1df3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760741255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165890/f7a1ab4fb0286b6681bcf66651cb35ed2e2e1df3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760741255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Among the Stars</i> is a <strong>competitive 2D rhythm game</strong> featuring a minimalist and modern design, along with an electronic soundtrack. Immerse yourself in a space-themed universe where each note challenges your reflexes and skill. With <strong>regular esports competitions</strong> and a <strong>built-in level editor</strong>, <i>Among the Stars</i> lets you not only play but create and share your own unique levels. Perfect for rhythm game enthusiasts looking for both solo and competitive play!</p>","developers":["Nils Crettenand"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic